message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Avaliador de Vibração Humana"
abstract: >-
  Python implementation, with graphical interface, of the whole-body vibration
  risk assessment methods of ISO 2631-5:2018 (Annexes A and E; Clause 5 and
  Annex C) and of the health and comfort evaluations of ISO 2631-1, NHO-09 and
  Directive 2002/44/EC. Developed at GRAVI-SH, Federal University of Minas
  Gerais (UFMG).
authors:
